% strictspec smoke test
{ 0 0 moveto (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213/22/ABC%2D123?99=XYZ-987) (includetext strictspec xdim=0.495) gs1dldatamatrix true } true isEqual

% AST bounds: xdim below xmin fails
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213/22/ABC%2D123?99=XYZ-987) (dontdraw strictspec xdim=0.300) gs1dldatamatrix } /bwipp.renderXdimTooSmall isError

% strictspec: xdim resolves from default AST xnom (0.495)
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213/22/ABC%2D123?99=XYZ-987) (dontdraw strictspec) gs1dldatamatrix dup /strictspec get exch /xdim get 2 array astore } [true 0.495] isEqual

% Structured Append is not used in the GS1 system
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213) (dontdraw sampos=1 samtotal=2 samid=1) gs1dldatamatrix } /bwipp.gs1dldatamatrixStructuredAppend isError
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213) (dontdraw sampos=1) gs1dldatamatrix } /bwipp.gs1dldatamatrixStructuredAppend isError
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213) (dontdraw samtotal=2) gs1dldatamatrix } /bwipp.gs1dldatamatrixStructuredAppend isError
{ (https://id.gs1.org/01/09521234543213) (dontdraw samid=1) gs1dldatamatrix } /bwipp.gs1dldatamatrixStructuredAppend isError

